   "date": "2026-06-25",
   "url": "https://healthit.gov/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/HHS-Accelerating-the-Adoption-of-Clinical-AI-RFI-event-transcript.pdf",
   "text": "So utilizing AI is a help in terms of targeting their specific skill sets to employers who are hiring people with disabilities and reasonable accommodations and the like.",
